{"code":0,"message":"success","value":{"docId":"3cb24eaef2a2459ea5cc42236b4dc107","title":"申请Wear Engine服务","lang":"cn","domain":"10100000","businessName":"HMS Core > Smart Devices","businessType":"10101014","businessTypeName":"穿戴能力","serviceType":"5734b590f11f4e839a20a8642c1a1a29","version":"V32","anchorList":[],"status":"4","content":{"content":"<html><head></head><body><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218\"></a><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218\"></a>   <h1>申请Wear Engine服务</h1>   <div>    <p>申请Wear Engine服务前，请先按照<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/registering-applying-account-0000001050818011\">注册账号及申请账号服务</a>的操作，申请账号服务。</p>    <ol>     <li><span>点击“应用服务”&gt;“开发服务”下的“Wear Engine”卡片。</span>      <p></p>      <div class=\"fignone\">       <span class=\"figcap\"><b>图1 </b>“Wear Engine”卡片</span>      </div>      <p><span><img height=\"399.16359\" originheight=\"484\" originwidth=\"1263\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/e1/v3/cwv8cuefRuK_qmC4j9rZJg/zh-cn_image_0000002503611715.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=4BFCA956DABFD85CB3DF6FF7E640AA412B590575B19B1A8289E6D26F301E0B58\" title=\"点击放大\" width=\"1008.4725000000001\"></span></p>      <p></p>      <div class=\"note\">       <img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/36/v3/i2ucw7BQTUCmbaEY9hAF9w/note_3.0-zh-cn.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=6E8579945775DB32AF48294B833EBAEEB08E64CC161F3C7B0D7C7DC11F0295CB\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span>       <div class=\"notebody\">        <p>如果无“Wear Engine”卡片。请点击“开发服务”标签右边图标<span><img originheight=\"22\" originwidth=\"28\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/d6/v3/PmydtkM7RaSZeENpViOwMg/zh-cn_image_0000002503452959.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=1EBA47BBCC4D03DA0C6EDD42C6A55FBA4CAEB461FDEDE5D94F3DBD5FBD2888F8\"></span>添加卡片。</p>        <p><span><img height=\"565.5734560000001\" originheight=\"733\" originwidth=\"1295\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/82/v3/KuRelNNlRiipvt-vxvCZFQ/zh-cn_image_0000002470692804.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=30BAED70E14D9475844620E665831A20656A12B6ECB148DF0EF11780BD8B67C6\" title=\"点击放大\" width=\"982.5375\"></span></p>        <p></p>       </div>      </div>      <p></p></li>    </ol>    <ol start=\"2\">     <li><span>点击“申请Wear Engine服务”，同意协议后，进入权限申请页面。</span>      <p></p>      <div class=\"fignone\">       <span class=\"figcap\"><b>图2 </b>申请Wear Engine服务</span>      </div>      <p><span><img height=\"340.45872\" originheight=\"403\" originwidth=\"1242\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/19/v3/O2ZBOto0RgqgrpAMP-IPbQ/zh-cn_image_0000002470533446.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=4578E66644C94F5A50AA85553B8214754BE5837BA9D69762701AD1C64FBFF9EC\" title=\"点击放大\" width=\"1005.729375\"></span></p>      <p></p>      <p></p></li>     <li><span>点击“Android应用”并选择产品后，勾选必需申请的权限。</span>      <p></p>      <div class=\"note\">       <img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/57/v3/20i01hbkSfWSFSyzU0N10g/note_3.0-zh-cn.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=9EDE117EB1437A64960B1559A03F21598CD9EAED7FC224254187ABA32EC894C3\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span>       <div class=\"notebody\">        <ul>         <li>请选择手机侧应用，穿戴设备侧应用默认不需要申请权限。</li>         <li>若未能正确选择产品，请按照<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/registering-applying-account-0000001050818011\">注册账号及申请账号服务</a>的操作，申请账号服务。</li>         <li>个人开发者只可申请<a href=\"#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p144135716461\">设备基础信息</a>、<a href=\"#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p9640134154416\">消息通知</a>两个基本的权限。</li>         <li>人体传感器相关权限受限开放，仅限专业研究机构使用。如未提前与华为确认，请勿申请该权限。</li>        </ul>       </div>      </div>      <p></p>      <div class=\"p\">       <span><img height=\"761.2669960000001\" originheight=\"890\" originwidth=\"1200\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/c2/v3/6ch1fT2pTuWjtO6J2-RSpQ/zh-cn_image_0000002679897661.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=E6989CD5D9DC5B61724D1922F7559AB69B93BA2B4761B680FE3987CF6972507A\" title=\"点击放大\" width=\"1026.4275\"></span>       <div class=\"tablenoborder\">        <a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__table99191256194614\"></a><a name=\"table99191256194614\"></a>        <table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__table99191256194614\">         <caption>          <b>表1 </b>权限说明         </caption>         <thead>          <tr>           <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.3.2.2.3.2.2.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\">            <p>权限</p>           </th>           <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" colspan=\"2\" id=\"mcps1.3.3.2.2.3.2.2.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\">            <p>开放能力</p>           </th>           <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.3.2.2.3.2.2.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\">            <p>用途</p>           </th>          </tr>         </thead>                   <tbody><tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.77%\">            <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p144135716461\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p144135716461\"></a><a name=\"p144135716461\"></a>设备基础信息</p>            <p><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__DEVICE_MANAGER\" target=\"_blank\">DEVICE_MANAGER</a></p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10.69%\">            <p>穿戴设备状态管理</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"24.7%\">            <p>穿戴设备基础信息查询</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49.84%\">            <p>获取已配对穿戴设备列表并选定设备；支持查询穿戴设备可用空间。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>查询或订阅穿戴设备状态</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>支持查询电量状态；订阅低电量告警；查询或订阅穿戴设备连接状态、可用空间、充电状态。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">            <p>通信能力管理</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>发送点对点消息/文件</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>手机侧“xxx(应用名)”向穿戴设备侧“xxx(应用名)”发送消息/文件。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>接收点对点消息/文件</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>手机侧“xxx(应用名)”接收穿戴设备侧“xxx(应用名)”消息/文件。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.77%\">            <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p9640134154416\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p9640134154416\"></a><a name=\"p9640134154416\"></a>消息通知</p>            <p><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__NOTIFY\" target=\"_blank\">NOTIFY</a></p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10.69%\">            <p>消息通知能力管理</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"24.7%\">            <p>向穿戴设备侧发送通知</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49.84%\">            <p>手机侧应用向穿戴设备发送通知，并在穿戴设备上按模板显示。支持设置消息标题、内容、按钮。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.77%\">            <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p281553519149\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p281553519149\"></a><a name=\"p281553519149\"></a>穿戴用户状态</p>            <p><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__section1423182224014\" target=\"_blank\">WEAR_USER_STATUS</a></p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10.69%\">            <p>穿戴用户状态管理</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"24.7%\">            <p>查询或订阅穿戴用户状态</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49.84%\">            <p>查询和订阅用户佩戴状态；订阅用户心率告警。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" rowspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.77%\">            <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p1258911943515\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p1258911943515\"></a><a name=\"p1258911943515\"></a>人体传感器</p>            <p><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__SENSOR\" target=\"_blank\">SENSOR</a></p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" rowspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10.69%\">            <p>人体传感器和I/O能力</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"24.7%\">            <p>获取人体传感器列表</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49.84%\">            <p>获取穿戴设备侧支持的传感器信息列表。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>读取人体传感器数据</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>读取穿戴设备ECG、PPG、HR传感器数据。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>停止读取人体传感器</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>停止读取穿戴设备侧人体传感器。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" rowspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.77%\">            <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p18573111319352\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951218__p18573111319352\"></a><a name=\"p18573111319352\"></a>运动传感器</p>            <p><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/permission-0000001059433005#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111234__section1410013154017\" target=\"_blank\">MOTION_SENSOR</a></p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" rowspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"10.69%\">            <p>运动传感器和I/O能力</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"24.7%\">            <p>获取运动传感器列表</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49.84%\">            <p>获取穿戴设备侧支持的传感器信息列表。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>读取运动传感器数据</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>读取穿戴设备ACC、GYRO、MAG传感器数据。</p>           </td>          </tr>          <tr>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>停止读取运动传感器</p>           </td>           <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\">            <p>停止读取穿戴设备侧运动传感器。</p>           </td>          </tr>                 </tbody></table>       </div>      </div>      <p></p></li>     <li><span>上传申请数据权限及使用说明、用户授权路径说明，选择授权入口是否展示华为品牌LOGO后提交。</span>      <p></p>      <ul>       <li>申请数据权限及使用说明填写要求：        <ul>         <li>权限说明：提供申请的数据权限，每个权限一行。</li>         <li>数据使用说明：提供使用数据权限的需求、场景、目的和方式等。</li>         <li>数据展示路径：提供所申请权限的使用场景的界面截图。可选。</li>        </ul></li>       <li>用户授权路径说明填写要求：        <ul>         <li>提供获取用户授权的界面截图及界面操作路径的文字描述。</li>         <li>如果应用内提供了修改授权的功能，请提供修改授权的界面截图及界面操作路径的文字描述。可选。</li>        </ul></li>      </ul>      <div class=\"note\">       <img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/dd/v3/G-sWAUzoQYOybO5vlEQNSg/note_3.0-zh-cn.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=CE1D477DFEF7D945C508CB6F33BACC563B80D457A746FF60DA72D112948F3C2A\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span>       <div class=\"notebody\">        <ul>         <li>数据使用说明：<a href=\"https://hihealthbase-drcn.things.hicloud.com/healthkit/fileServer/getFile/plain/usageDescForIndividual/000/001/044/1000000000000001044.20251209032349.74589818940681309738674024154756:20751127032356:100005355:24B697F375223CCF34910C9D8DA18079134D1018EC6FEE201016FFC73DCE3CFA.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">申请数据权限及使用说明（范例）个人开发者.xlsx</a>、<a href=\"https://hihealthbase-drcn.things.hicloud.com/healthkit/fileServer/getFile/plain/usageDescForEnterprise/000/001/044/1000000000000001044.20251209032231.78198893037413673087257560319146:20751127032255:100005355:C2F902BA7C9CF53088CDFDA5B72F4CCE2B34C11FB8BC48637D97244075BF17B9.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">申请数据权限及使用说明（范例）企业开发者.xlsx</a>。</li>         <li>用户授权路径说明：<a href=\"https://hihealthbase-drcn.things.hicloud.com/healthkit/fileServer/getFile/plain/authDisplayDesc/000/001/062/1000000000000001062.20260228015622.62864815611324569060780795144875:20760216015648:100005355:4D88BD3183D7B4DE07ACDD94FFFD8BD10BD271850BFB585F1215324979201B64.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">用户授权路径说明（范例）</a>。</li>        </ul>       </div>      </div>      <p></p></li>     <li><span>等待申请通过。</span>      <p></p>      <p>权限审批一般需要1到2周。取决于申请的权限类型和应用发布地区，我们将视应用发布地区的相关要求进行权限开放的评估。</p>      <p>如果提交的材料不满足要求，审批将不能通过。如果审批通过，即可进入开发测试阶段，完成开发测试后即可发布。</p>      <p>若您的业务范围发生变动，需要修改相应的数据权限，您可以点击“修改”重新提交申请。</p>      <div class=\"fignone\">       <span class=\"figcap\"><b>图3 </b>权限审批通过</span>      </div>      <p><span><img height=\"252.67872000000003\" originheight=\"381\" originwidth=\"1562\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/de/v3/nK6YnnLBQZyLNSoV7vb20A/zh-cn_image_0000002470740610.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T022434Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=195BE81C8FEBD5E71339FF0DC0705B8D44F71926890666AE246A50C36377EA1E\" title=\"点击放大\" width=\"1007.205675\"></span></p>      <p></p>      <p></p></li>    </ol>   </div>   <div></div></body></html>","metadata":{}},"catalogName":"connectivity-Guides","isImport":2,"tag":"10102010","fileName":"applying-wearengine-0000001050777982","navigationAddress":"/hmos/hms/smart-device","updatedDate":"2026-10-10 04:06:05","serviceBreadUrl":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/hms/huawei-wearengine","websiteType":"1","isGray":0,"restrictedType":0,"subTitle":"Smart Device","domainBreadName":"","searchTitle":"","keywords":"","intelligentRecommendFlag":false,"versionLabels":["hmos"],"contentLabels":["celin-hmos","hms-core","notuse"],"showBeta":0,"displayUpdateTime":"2026-10-10 11:04:00","deviceVersion":""}}